{"id":"c26f09046479028a","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-hierarchy-def.md","title":"Hierarchy Definition","display":"df-hierarchy-def — Hierarchy Definition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hierarchy-def","aliases":["58-df-hierarchy-def"],"display":"df-hierarchy-def — Hierarchy Definition","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hierarchy-def"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hierarchy-def</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hierarchy-def — Hierarchy Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9a2e92340a207163\" href=\"?note=9a2e92340a207163\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md\">../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Def}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Def}(M)\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span> (definability-class operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9a2e92340a207163\" href=\"?note=9a2e92340a207163\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md\">../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\\in V\">\\(L_\\alpha\\in V\\)</span> for every set ordinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> (definable-class notation introduced here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}def} \\vdash L_0=\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to L_{\\beta+1}=\\mathrm{Def}(L_\\beta)\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to L_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}L_\\beta\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}def} \\vdash L_0=\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to L_{\\beta+1}=\\mathrm{Def}(L_\\beta)\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to L_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}L_\\beta\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\alpha}\">\\(L_{\\alpha}\\)</span> is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-th level of Gödel's constructible hierarchy.  The family is a definable class, not a set function whose domain is the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L = \\bigcup_{\\alpha \\in \\mathrm{Ord}} L_{\\alpha}\">\\(L = \\bigcup_{\\alpha \\in \\mathrm{Ord}} L_{\\alpha}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a2e92340a207163","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a2e92340a207163","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Def}(M)$ for $M\\in V$ (definability-class operation, see [[../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V$ (limit-ordinal predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Def}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}def} \\vdash L_0=\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to L_{\\beta+1}=\\mathrm{Def}(L_\\beta)\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to L_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}L_\\beta\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"L_{\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"L = \\bigcup_{\\alpha \\in \\mathrm{Ord}} L_{\\alpha}","display":false}],"bytes":1325,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-618","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-hierarchy-def.md|58-df-hierarchy-def]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["81cabbac7fa4d75d","9a2e92340a207163","5582a281f15a33c2"]}